protoweft-model-bge-small-en-v15

This artifact contains a third-party model and its vocabulary, unmodified, and no code.

Model: BAAI bge-small-en-v1.5
  https://huggingface.co/BAAI/bge-small-en-v1.5
  By the Beijing Academy of Artificial Intelligence (BAAI). The model card declares the MIT
  License and points to the FlagEmbedding license, reproduced in LICENSE:
  https://github.com/FlagOpen/FlagEmbedding/blob/master/LICENSE

model.onnx
  The quantized ONNX export by Xenova (Transformers.js):
  https://huggingface.co/Xenova/bge-small-en-v1.5/blob/main/onnx/model_quantized.onnx
  SHA-256 6c9c6101a956d62dfb5e7190c538226c0c5bb9cb27b651234b6df063ee7dbfe4, 34,014,426 bytes.
  Copied from bge-small-en-v1.5-q.onnx in the Maven Central artifact
  dev.langchain4j:langchain4j-embeddings-bge-small-en-v15-q:1.23.0-beta33, which redistributes
  the same file.

vocab.txt
  The model's WordPiece vocabulary, 30,522 entries, one per line, line number = token id.
  Written from the tokenizer.json in that artifact (byte-identical to tokenizer.json in both
  BAAI/bge-small-en-v1.5 and Xenova/bge-small-en-v1.5); the result is byte-identical to
  https://huggingface.co/BAAI/bge-small-en-v1.5/blob/main/vocab.txt
  SHA-256 07eced375cec144d27c900241f3e339478dec958f92fddbc551f295c992038a3.
